{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Age App 是一款以卡片整理重要日子的倒數與累計工具，適合想追蹤孩子、寵物年齡、紀念日、旅行倒數或物品使用時間的人。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-13.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>日期卡片一眼看清</h2>\n<p>新增日期即可建立卡片，自動顯示自過去日期起已過多久，或距離未來日期尚餘多少年、月、日；開啟時間選項後，亦可查看時、分、秒。你可為卡片加入備註、設定文字與背景顏色，拖曳排序、複製卡片，並搜尋標題及備註。所有卡片會透過個人 iCloud 在 iPhone、iPad 與 Mac 之間同步。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1260x2736bb-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1260x2736bb-1-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1260x2736bb-2-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1260x2736bb-3-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1260x2736bb-4-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1260x2736bb-5-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Age App: Days Since &amp; Until</li><li>應用類別：Lifestyle</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/age-app-days-since-until/id6770559161?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:50.407958+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":297,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T05:52:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T10:19:02.235339+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T00:42:12.679316+00:00","content_hash":"5b9a6148d164ca3e48cb7c32fbf1fedb069a068e372696d317a1d5790a163140","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}